// Title: File Download via CertOC.EXE
// ID: 70ad0861-d1fe-491c-a45f-fa48148a300d
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-05-16
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Description: Detects when a user downloads a file by using CertOC.exe
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_-GetCACAPS*" and process.command_line like "*_http*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\certoc.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "CertOC.exe")))
